BUT `Visionary` has Prowess.\n\
If they cast `Sure Strike`, `Visionary` gets +1/+1 (Prowess) +3/+0 (Spell) = +4/+1 total.\n\
So `Visionary` becomes 6/2 First Strike.\n\
If unblocked: I take 6 damage. I DIE.\n\
So I MUST block `Visionary` if there's any chance of Prowess/Pump.\n\
So I will block `Visionary` with `Giant` (or `Triton`).\n\
Prefer blocking with `Giant`? No, if `Giant` blocks and they have trick, `Giant` dies.\n\
If `Giant` blocks and NO trick, `Visionary` dies.\n\
